    "https://jobs.auburn.edu/auburn-careers-home": {
      "title": "Working",
      "description": "Auburn Careers Home Skip to Main Content Internal Candidates Returning Candidate Candidate Dashboard Manage Job Alerts Toggle navigation Jobs Home Apply Process Search Jobs Internal Candidates Returning Candidate Candidate Dashboard Manage Job Alerts Working at Auburn Job Opportunities Our Work Changes Lives At Auburn, we shape the future of Alabama, the nation, and the world through innovative education, life-changing research, and dedicated service. And we believe in investing in the employees who have made Auburn one of the top universities in the nation by expanding opportunities for a purposeful, rewarding life and career. Faculty Staff Students Experience Exceptional Benefits A career at Auburn means a path to health and wellness, educational opportunities, a solid financial future and time to enjoy those benefits. Health and Wellness Our comprehensive health insurance packages, along with wellness programs for employees and their families, ensure peace of mind and prioritize your well-being. Health, Dental and Vision Options Flexible Spending Account Employee Pharmacy Medical Leave Health Benefits Retirement All eligible Auburn University employees are enrolled in the Retirement Systems of Alabama. Additional voluntary retirement plans are available as well as retirement education to help employees build a solid financial future. Retirement Systems of Alabama Voluntary 403(b) and 457(b) Retirement Benefits More Advantages Benefits extend beyond health and retirement with education benefits for both employees and their dependents. Auburn also offers employees generous leave and holidays to encourage work/life balance. Employee Discounts Holidays Educational Opportunities More Benefits Why Auburn #1 University Auburn is consistently ranked the #1 university in Alabama and among the top public universities in the nation. Top Research Institution Auburn is a top-tier Carnegie R1 university, ranking in the top 11% nationwide. Named a Best-In-State Employer Forbes recently recognized Auburn for providing employees an exceptional workplace environment. Calling Auburn Home Consistently ranked one of the best college towns in the South, Auburn is easy to call home. Both Auburn and neighboring Opelika have top-ranked school systems, charming downtowns and vibrant communities. Explore Auburn & Opelika Explore Campus Auburn takes care of their employees, listens to their concerns, and strives to make it a better place every day. Daffny Pierce Coord II, Business/Admin Svcs Air Force ROTC I love working at Auburn University because I have the freedom to inspire and make positive change within my division. Joseph Brame HR Generalist III Harbert College of Business Feels like we are part of a big family working to make Alabama a better place to live. Carmen Flammini Regional Agent Alabama Cooperative Extension System My favorite thing about working at Auburn are the people I get to collaborate with to showcase their amazing work and passion. Brooke Bailey Sr. Communications Manager Office of Communications and Marketing Auburn provides an exceptional student experience because we practice the principles of the Creed in all we do. This emphasis on servant leadership fosters a welcoming campus environment where everyone—from faculty and staff to students—can find their place and feel at home. Bobby R. Woodard, Ph.D. Senior Vice President for Student Affairs See jobs by: Categories Brands Locations Stay Connected Join Our Talent Network Connect with Auburn HR Contact Us Auburn, Alabama 36849 (334) 844-4000 Website Feedback Campus Links Auburn University at Montgomery Alabama Cooperative Extension System Alabama Agricultural Experiment Station Visitors Guide to Campus Resources Campus Safety/Emergency Preparedness Distance and Continuing Education Office of Information Technology Employment Equal Opportunity Compliance Accessibility Privacy Statement A-Z Index Copyright © 2026 Scroll to top Scroll to top Cookies are used on this site to assist in continually improving the candidate experience and all the interaction data we store of our visitors is anonymous. Learn more about your rights on our Privacy Policy page. Okay x"
